      "Issue 2: The Location Pin Is Off by Several Block Lengths. Solution: If using a search address, Google Maps may point to a general neighborhood center. To fix this, drop an explicit pin on the exact building entrance or parking lot in Google Maps, copy those direct latitude/longitude coordinates, and re-generate your QR code.",
